heap=4096  MiB  n=8     GOMAXPROCS=128   idle-goroutines=1000000  stack-goroutines=200  ptrheap=true  toucher=false  gcgap=5s  discard=2

Wall-clock time per runtime.GC() call (includes concurrent phases):
